cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use matview in published work, please cite it.
title: "matview: materialized views for derived values"
abstract: >-
  A content-addressed compute cache over a dependency graph. Recipes declare how a value
  is computed from parameters and from other recipes' outputs; the graph is recorded as
  it runs rather than declared, staleness is decided by content digests rather than
  timestamps, and results are memoized in SQLite for reuse across processes and machines.
type: software
